id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,T,\\alpha,t,h,\\leq_T\\in V\">\\(R,T,\\alpha,t,h,\\leq_T\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\)</span> (tree-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order\">58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11RankInitialSubtree}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11RankInitialSubtree}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pred}(T,\\leq_T,t)\">\\(\\operatorname{Pred}(T,\\leq_T,t)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-tree.md\">../batch18/58-df-tree.md</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md\">../batch11/58-df-order-type.md</a>，其第三参数为严格良序关系。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}rank\\text{-}initial\\text{-}subtree}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree11RankInitialSubtree}_S(R,T,\\leq_T,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\leq_T)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\;\\Bigl(t\\in R\\leftrightarrow t\\in T\\land\n\\exists P\\in V\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\nP=\\operatorname{Pred}(T,\\leq_T,t)\\land\n\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\beta,P,\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in P\\times P:u\\neq v\\land\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in\\leq_T\\})\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}rank\\text{-}initial\\text{-}subtree}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree11RankInitialSubtree}_S(R,T,\\leq_T,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\leq_T)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\;\\Bigl(t\\in R\\leftrightarrow t\\in T\\land\n\\exists P\\in V\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\nP=\\operatorname{Pred}(T,\\leq_T,t)\\land\n\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\beta,P,\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in P\\times P:u\\neq v\\land\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in\\leq_T\\})\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> consists exactly of the nodes of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> whose tree height is below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Renaming the subtree parameter removes its collision with the ambient-setting subscript <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The tree order is an explicit argument, and the height is expanded as the order type of the predecessor set, eliminating a second hidden free-order dependency.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md","status":"resolved","id":"5d2cd56a38a81b7a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-order-type.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S$ (tree-order predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S$ (ordinal predicate, see [[58-df-ordinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Pred}(T,\\leq_T,t)$ 使用 [[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]]；$\\mathrm{OrderType}_S$ 使用 [[../batch11/58-df-order-type.md]]，其第三参数为严格良序关系。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md","status":"resolved","id":"5d2cd56a38a81b7a","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Pred}(T,\\leq_T,t)$ 使用 [[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]]；$\\mathrm{OrderType}_S$ 使用 [[../batch11/58-df-order-type.md]]，其第三参数为严格良序关系。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"R,T,\\alpha,t,h,\\leq_T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11RankInitialSubtree}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pred}(T,\\leq_T,t)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrderType}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}rank\\text{-}initial\\text{-}subtree}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree11RankInitialSubtree}_S(R,T,\\leq_T,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\leq_T)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}_S(\\alpha)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall t\\;\\Bigl(t\\in R\\leftrightarrow t\\in T\\land\n\\exists P\\in V\\;\\exists\\beta\\in\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\nP=\\operatorname{Pred}(T,\\leq_T,t)\\land\n\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\beta,P,\\{\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in P\\times P:u\\neq v\\land\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in\\leq_T\\})\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":1877,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3799","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-tree11-rank-initial-subtree.md|58-df-zfc-tree11-rank-initial-subtree]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d25b709595952a78","5582a281f15a33c2","5d2cd56a38a81b7a","f06e57c5c0b1354d"]}